5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m so excited to finally pick our next big show! I just want to make sure we don’t get blindsided by surprise costs later.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m less concerned about the show itself and more about who will actually be left to run it once the opening day arrives.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The record should speak before we commit. I want to know what audiences actually returned for, not what we thought was impressive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building itself is a constraint. I need to know what the floor and structure can physically absorb before we promise the space to anyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the delivery side. We’ve approved things in good faith, only to spend the season apologising at the door.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that’s a fair point. I’m picking loan transport costs and mount-making charges to see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I’ll check conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster. We need to know who is actually available to work, not just who is on paper.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I’ll review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips. The data will show what actually draws people back, not just what looks good on paper.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I’ll look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the evening hire bookings. I need to see where the schedule actually breaks down before we promise anything.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
