21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: We shall see if the reality matches our hopes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: The data will not be kind, but it will be honest.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: The structure will not negotiate. I will report exactly what it can bear.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: I trust the records will tell us the truth, however inconvenient it may be.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
