35,2,1,talk,Mio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,- **Mio**: The transport costs are terrifying. Nearly a third of our installation budget just vanished into couriers and insurance.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,- **Mio**: The transport costs are terrifying. Nearly a third of our installation budget just vanished into couriers and insurance.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: The structure is the final word. I will report exactly what the bay can bear, without negotiation.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: I found two openings slipped because paperwork arrived after the shipping cut-off. We must plan for delays, not hope for speed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: And bespoke mounts are charged per object, with joiner rates up fifty percent. Anything self-supported saves us dearly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: The lab is down to one person with two hundred pieces waiting. The volunteer list is mostly history walkers, not installers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: The head counts climb where mechanisms run, and comment slips name live presence as the reason for return visits.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,- **Asuka**: The bay caps at four hundred kilos per square metre. Last season’s stonework needed shoring and a rerouted delivery.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: And the evening hires leave open displays damaged. We cannot promise a gallery that is half-booked for caterers.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Shion, that live presence data is huge! It really changes how I see the budget priorities now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Mio, that transport figure is staggering. It confirms my fear that we are funding logistics, not the art itself.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Asuka, your structural limit is a hard wall. If the mechanism is too heavy, the data is irrelevant.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Shion, precisely. The physics do not care about your audience numbers. If it exceeds the limit, it does not go in.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Mio, your transport costs and my paperwork delays are two sides of the same coin. We are bleeding money and time before the doors even open.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Shizue, exactly! We need a show that travels light and doesn’t need a mountain of custom mounts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Shion, your data on live presence is vital, but my staffing report shows we lack the hands to provide it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"- **Shion**: @Victoria, a contradiction. The data demands presence, yet you report no hands. We must choose between an empty, impressive room or a crowded, understaffed one.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Shion, the structure is the final filter. If the weight exceeds the limit, your audience data is irrelevant.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the contradiction is real, but the solution is simple: choose a show that needs no heavy rigging and no distant loans.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
